    {
      "id": "CIN-A",
      "duration": 45,
      "frames": 1080,
      "shots": [
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-A-00-8cdbe15e998206ff3212.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/A-01.png",
          "sha256": "34071279079f4195390c1e31743c961334a928beaefa068df83085d10083e44a",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "被撕碎的威脅信",
          "index": 0,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "zh": "灰綠外套與散落原稿留下記者的痕跡。那封信，是她恐懼的來源。",
          "en": "The coat and scattered drafts marked the reporter’s presence. The letter explained her fear."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-A-01-47df5ecac7ddb09a4681.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/A-02.png",
          "sha256": "e5bca8dd17e58637ba1cb379bb78fa30558d815b3dbf3c462a78234c5fd2fb93",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 1,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 18,
          "zh": "被刪掉的房內對話，讓我找到了衣架後的文書。真正被隱藏的是她保留的調查資料。",
          "en": "Deleted room instructions led to papers behind the coat rack. She had concealed investigative leads."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-A-02-dfdd0d33802e208e6590.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/A-02.png",
          "sha256": "e5bca8dd17e58637ba1cb379bb78fa30558d815b3dbf3c462a78234c5fd2fb93",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "林依瑤的隱藏筆記",
          "index": 2,
          "start": 18,
          "end": 27,
          "zh": "她隱匿的，是原本能繼續追查的線索。為了名聲，她把事件寫成懸案。",
          "en": "She had suppressed leads to preserve the attention of an unsolved case."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-A-03-03a124de2d6d8df16720.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/A-02.png",
          "sha256": "e5bca8dd17e58637ba1cb379bb78fa30558d815b3dbf3c462a78234c5fd2fb93",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "五年前新聞剪報",
          "index": 3,
          "start": 27,
          "end": 36,
          "zh": "報紙與私人筆記並不一致。但她的秘密，還不能證明她犯下今晚的罪。",
          "en": "The clipping and private notes differed. Her secret did not prove responsibility for tonight."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-A-04-7560bd60951997d15f30.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/EVIDENCE-01.png",
          "sha256": "8aacceef4bf7b719a8025588f5f9b942de5aba952528affd20ff4c6d14a432ed",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 4,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 45,
          "zh": "三只杯子與空瓶留下殘留。此刻，我只能記錄，不能用肉眼完成鑑定。",
          "en": "Three glasses and a bottle held residues. I could record them, not identify them by sight."
        }
      ],
      "audioSource": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-A-compatible-v9.mp4",
