    {
      "id": "CIN-B",
      "duration": 49.5,
      "frames": 1188,
      "shots": [
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-B-00-087d23b854a158c208de.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/B-01.png",
          "sha256": "bd56c4448e692b3e0c73b9e8d03771e62c5535cca91aa4362133dad370e858c7",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 0,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "zh": "手機保留了拍攝預覽與工作花絮，警方交付的是當晚匯出的副本。",
          "en": "The phone retained previews and work fragments. Police supplied a copy exported that night."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-B-01-c03ce5fb4d6833ece727.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/B-04.png",
          "sha256": "00636e556841d1bfa5482ef6c2e4df618901486dfd1a5600ab913502164a6fc8",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "18:30第一張合照",
          "index": 1,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 18,
          "zh": "十八點三十分，四人在鏡頭前。劉子傑掌鏡，偵探尚未到場。",
          "en": "At 18:30 four people stood in frame. Liu Zijie held the camera; I had not arrived."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-B-02-0ac54fa4d3eab74bc7e8.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/B-02.png",
          "sha256": "2c18932d7152251a4fa25e74114182b8c8b74d373bd7bc24c920f5d73834e9c7",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "20:00最後合照",
          "index": 2,
          "start": 18,
          "end": 27,
          "zh": "二十點，鏡頭前只剩三人。劉涵消失了。",
          "en": "At 20:00 only three remained in frame. Liu Han was absent."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-B-03-d206f07b16d4a263552f.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/B-03.png",
          "sha256": "9d3ed578dc6bfcec48f5fd8521e2ec2011f5d712eceb2c20c8d5e21a46a22995",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 324,
          "title": "攝影師工作紀錄 1/2",
          "index": 3,
          "start": 27,
          "end": 40.5,
          "zh": "缺席不是死亡證明。我需要把時刻、工作片段與其他痕跡放在一起。",
          "en": "Absence was not proof of death. I needed to compare the times, recordings and traces."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-B-04-c15521b01faef0b6b228.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/B-03.png",
          "sha256": "9d3ed578dc6bfcec48f5fd8521e2ec2011f5d712eceb2c20c8d5e21a46a22995",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "攝影師工作紀錄 2/2",
          "index": 4,
          "start": 40.5,
          "end": 49.5,
          "zh": "缺席不是死亡證明。我需要把時刻、工作片段與其他痕跡放在一起。",
          "en": "Absence was not proof of death. I needed to compare the times, recordings and traces."
        }
      ],
