    {
      "id": "CIN-C",
      "duration": 73.5,
      "frames": 1764,
      "shots": [
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-00-7dd1bc3723e3c9a5a21b.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-01.png",
          "sha256": "8df667653a945a0ec051f71f845782ff6f2df93f5cd964f32e34af883ac32bf7",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 0,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "zh": "劉涵是成年恩人好友。這次聚會，他只希望讓王杰倫重新開心。",
          "en": "Liu Han, an adult friend and benefactor, had hoped to cheer Wang up."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-01-f3162c0e0622407b302f.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-02.png",
          "sha256": "5d5ec24392980caffdaece134c01af76fb9f8bd81ab5e86dfd1fe619133b1a95",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "劉涵的日記殘頁",
          "index": 1,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 18,
          "zh": "十九點十分，他還在為自己的好意道歉。",
          "en": "At 19:10 he was still apologizing for a well-meant gesture."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-02-fed54dc0200dbf4f63fe.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/WATCH.png",
          "sha256": "7931f5adc5898f3a78d61b4ed86b209f692d925be6dca694d3ba16a6f9520f59",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "19:15破裂手錶",
          "index": 2,
          "start": 18,
          "end": 27,
          "zh": "儲藏室的錶停在十九點十五分，血痕旁有擦拭與撞擊痕跡。",
          "en": "The storage-room watch stopped at 19:15, beside wiped blood and impact traces."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-03-9cc03032d2ab4ad73d8c.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-02.png",
          "sha256": "5d5ec24392980caffdaece134c01af76fb9f8bd81ab5e86dfd1fe619133b1a95",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 252,
          "title": "表層診療報告副本",
          "index": 3,
          "start": 27,
          "end": 37.5,
          "zh": "表層報告讓我一度把顫抖看成對火的恐懼。這只是暫時推測。",
          "en": "The visible report made me read the trembling as fear of fire. It was only a hypothesis."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-04-12a6942d5b78a625ad1b.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-05.png",
          "sha256": "c7c3f061726dd01b08f9ec6d6349902802e896fa60d422827dcbaa93c3708a1b",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "烤架歷史紀錄",
          "index": 4,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 46.5,
          "zh": "預定食材五公斤，歷史淨載重卻是六十五公斤；即時值與歷史分開保存。",
          "en": "Five kilograms of planned food, but sixty-five in the historical record. Current and historical values were separate."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-05-306ea7273d8df83109c9.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-05.png",
          "sha256": "c7c3f061726dd01b08f9ec6d6349902802e896fa60d422827dcbaa93c3708a1b",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "地下室內門鑰匙",
          "index": 5,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 55.5,
          "zh": "滑輪配重抬起檢修蓋後，我取得地下室內門鑰匙；底座顯示的六十五公斤仍是歷史紀錄。",
          "en": "After the pulley counterweight raised the service cover, I retrieved the inner-door key. The base’s 65 kg display remained the historical record."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-06-22ed2460942cdc39fbfd.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-04.png",
          "sha256": "be171ef9632e48b5cbb7456298898c3be1eda27047d5dea818b805843860a875",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "烤架下緣的項鍊",
          "index": 6,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 64.5,
          "zh": "開格後才可觸及的項鍊，輪廓與第一張照片一致。",
          "en": "The pendant, reachable only after opening the hatch, matched the first photograph."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-C-07-7a7c1a34634d6ba65792.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-01.png",
          "sha256": "8df667653a945a0ec051f71f845782ff6f2df93f5cd964f32e34af883ac32bf7",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 7,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 73.5,
          "zh": "日記、停錶、重量與項鍊指向同一處。但真正的原因，仍在地下。",
          "en": "The diary, watch, load and pendant converged. The reason remained below."
        }
      ],
      "audioSource": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-C-compatible-v7.mp4",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-C-compatible-v10.mp4",
          "type": "video/mp4; codecs=\"avc1.64001F, mp4a.40.2\"",
          "bytes": 2426382,
          "sha256": "70bd6d009523e26d0f5b2b85cffeb0ca75c83dc4b130aeffc93975b4096eae64",
          "decode": "pending"
        },
        {
          "path": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-C-compatible-v10.webm",
