      "poster": "assets/story-v10/CIN-C-v10.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "CIN-D",
      "duration": 96.0,
      "frames": 2304,
      "shots": [
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-00-21e4effc9206a93a2c81.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/world-v4/previews/clinic-source.png",
          "sha256": "f5f543f23ff988238681777e342b6efa3b584ff1298a8a7acb9138dd24804470",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 288,
          "title": "張萍的隱藏診療紀錄",
          "index": 0,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12.0,
          "zh": "問句不是結論。我從案史頁重建孔路，取出了張萍保留的完整紀錄。",
          "en": "Questions were not conclusions. The case-history pages led to Zhang Ping’s complete record."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-01-6b46a43a8887bf0b459b.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/world-v4/previews/old.webp",
          "sha256": "24aeea8f267947c88d1196179acdedff3ef9bc830c5cb4fba7be4fd693124cbc",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 1,
          "start": 12.0,
          "end": 21.0,
          "zh": "五年前，先有火災與受困，才有在極端飢餓下食用親屬遺體的往事。",
          "en": "Five years earlier the fire and entrapment came first, followed by consumption of relatives’ remains in extreme hunger."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-02-9c7101377ace70922b09.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-01.png",
          "sha256": "8df667653a945a0ec051f71f845782ff6f2df93f5cd964f32e34af883ac32bf7",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 2,
          "start": 21.0,
          "end": 30.0,
          "zh": "五年後的營火，喚醒的可能不是恐懼，而是王杰倫壓抑的食慾。",
          "en": "The new barbecue may have awakened Wang’s suppressed appetite rather than fear."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-03-1412de6cb5f18220a34e.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-02.png",
          "sha256": "5d5ec24392980caffdaece134c01af76fb9f8bd81ab5e86dfd1fe619133b1a95",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 3,
          "start": 30.0,
          "end": 39.0,
          "zh": "【案件重建】十九點十五分附近，劉涵在儲藏室遭襲，手錶撞裂。",
          "en": "[Reconstruction] Around 19:15 Liu Han was assaulted in storage and the watch shattered."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-04-bcac949450ce2dbb42db.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/C-05.png",
          "sha256": "c7c3f061726dd01b08f9ec6d6349902802e896fa60d422827dcbaa93c3708a1b",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 4,
          "start": 39.0,
          "end": 48.0,
          "zh": "【案件重建】異常載重與項鍊，把劉涵、儲藏室與烤架連在一起。",
          "en": "[Reconstruction] The load and pendant linked Liu Han, storage and the grill."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-05-133dd65548ce42d1e951.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/EVIDENCE-01.png",
          "sha256": "8aacceef4bf7b719a8025588f5f9b942de5aba952528affd20ff4c6d14a432ed",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 5,
          "start": 48.0,
          "end": 57.0,
          "zh": "工作片段顯示取瓶與三人後來失去活動；殘留成分仍待正式檢驗。",
          "en": "Fragments showed a bottle being taken and three guests later unresponsive. Residues still awaited testing."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-06-7ad3281e0a9b3c4815f3.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/D-03.png",
          "sha256": "0216ceedf03fec0dba1bab595d56f5e24a16606e234735e11bff019efd0c7dfb",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 288,
          "title": "當晚案件重建",
          "index": 6,
          "start": 57.0,
          "end": 69.0,
          "zh": "張萍的紀錄不是定罪書。我要用照片、日記與現場關係交叉重建。",
          "en": "Zhang’s notes were not a verdict. Photographs, diary and scene relationships had to corroborate one another."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-07-ac538ba65b3a03d9a410.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/D-06.png",
          "sha256": "57d7d16fb87455314f80ab5d7579c3f10d670a2a21473ac4dee5ad9cc062cb1c",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 7,
          "start": 69.0,
          "end": 78.0,
          "zh": "鐵櫃在火災中倒下。警方協助移開後，原先的通路才重新露出。",
          "en": "The cabinet fell in the fire. With police assistance it was moved, exposing the route."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-08-6ea698fad3b298f60a1f.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/D-07.png",
          "sha256": "baf9a4929258dfaac9d4bf33abbe55aa437e5484882c75411a1ff4113ce3fa46",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "維修出口痕跡",
          "index": 8,
          "start": 78.0,
          "end": 87.0,
          "zh": "門框先被使用，灰後來才覆上。痕跡只支持相對先後，不單獨認人。",
          "en": "The frame had been used before ash settled. Traces established order, not a unique person."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-D-09-636c4a8d4c6e9f836871.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/D-05.png",
          "sha256": "53f9787149eabbe2bd33fdc93031bfa42fcf314f4c1bc4f40f123e658e4dc815",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 216,
          "title": "",
          "index": 9,
          "start": 87.0,
          "end": 96.0,
          "zh": "主門反鎖，卻不代表所有出口封死。當晚不能確認王杰倫死亡，他可能已逃離。",
          "en": "A bolted main door did not seal every exit. Wang’s death was unconfirmed. He might have escaped."
        }
      ],
      "audioSource": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-D-compatible-v9.mp4",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-D-compatible-v10.mp4",
          "type": "video/mp4; codecs=\"avc1.64001F, mp4a.40.2\"",
          "bytes": 3982225,
          "sha256": "2892a6cffce59f336c3c2673f8fa40842fc7a436d8bd44c220a5e7e3313b9ab1",
          "decode": "pending"
        },
        {
          "path": "assets/playback-v6/video/CIN-D-compatible-v10.webm",
          "type": "video/webm; codecs=\"vp9, opus\"",
