    },
    {
      "id": "CIN-EPILOGUE",
      "duration": 62.0,
      "frames": 1488,
      "shots": [
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-EPILOGUE-00-7ecb7428e023dfcfd8f5.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/images/D-04.png",
          "sha256": "93acdb67449d941773e030cf54b96d265e7fcdbaca468462af196569361a3900",
          "person": null,
          "characterName": null,
          "frames": 288,
          "title": "數日後：正式身分核對",
          "index": 0,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12.0,
          "zh": "數日後，正式身分核對才完成。當晚的四具遺體，終於有了名字。",
          "en": "Days later formal identification was completed. The four bodies finally had names."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-EPILOGUE-01-b21a2b77f759a3eaf074.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/portraits/reporter.png",
          "sha256": "11c4d57430c2adf119a018aae5378d5ffb2665a73c4827a7eb531d7e4032d9fb",
          "person": "reporter",
          "characterName": "林依瑤",
          "frames": 240,
          "title": "林依瑤｜記者",
          "index": 1,
          "start": 12.0,
          "end": 22.0,
          "zh": "林依瑤。她為名聲壓下調查線索，失實報導令真相被延後；這不等於她犯下當晚罪行。",
          "en": "Lin Yiyao. She suppressed leads for attention. That does not establish responsibility for the new crime."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-EPILOGUE-02-9b9665dd3e8a83982cfe.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/portraits/benefactor.png",
          "sha256": "68712b64adad2c56436b25dd4c32ed612769e62b444bb18267e9d28fad2ebd4a",
          "person": "benefactor",
          "characterName": "劉涵",
          "frames": 240,
          "title": "劉涵｜成年恩人好友",
          "index": 2,
          "start": 22.0,
          "end": 32.0,
          "zh": "劉涵。他先於最後合照遭襲，與烤架異常及項鍊相關，也包括在四名死者之內。",
          "en": "Liu Han. Assaulted before the last photograph; connected to the grill and pendant, and included among the four dead."
        },
        {
          "file": "assets/story-v10/.render-cache/CIN-EPILOGUE-03-c4be073a3e580c591f4e.mp4",
          "sourceArt": "assets/art-redesign-v4/portraits/doctor.png",
          "sha256": "bf69c0f7a5d82110c2bc7f634dfca9d5bade85fcceeae7484a66da16f4860a9f",
          "person": "doctor",
          "characterName": "張萍",
          "frames": 240,
          "title": "張萍｜心理醫生",
          "index": 3,
          "start": 32.0,
          "end": 42.0,
          "zh": "張萍。保存五年前的隱藏診療紀錄；病歷不能直接認罪或洗清嫌疑，正式結果仍須交叉核對。",
          "en": "Zhang Ping. Held concealed clinical notes. A record alone establishes neither guilt nor innocence."
        },
